  message: "Fixed in PR #2091. java.py _java_is_exported: public, or a direct member of an interface/annotation body that is not private. Live repro on dev: interface Shape { double area(); private double helper() {...} } -> Shape.area is_exported True, Shape.helper False (area was False before). Test: test_java.py::test_interface_members_are_implicitly_public. The same PR fixed an order-dependent test_java_records DDG test that failed on dev in isolation."  # 618e
